<v Heider Garcia>它们被贴上了标签。这就是你想要的，对吧？所以他有那种“好的，好吧，在这点上你赢了”的时刻。我们一直在做像这样的小事。

00:17:54.380 --> 00:18:07.380
<v Zoe Chace>In theory, any election official could go this far-- answer every question-- if they wanted to. Though, in some ways, Heider's uniquely suited for this, he's a computer engineer. He's designed voting machines.
